      <Text>Rungs 2-4 control the start cmd, once pressed it activates the damper and the vfd. As well as energizing the bay_active_flag.
</Text>
      <RtfText>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Microsoft Sans Serif;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green128\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs17 Rungs 2-4 control the start cmd, once pressed it activates the damper and the vfd. As well as energizing the bay_active_flag.\par
\par
}
</RtfText>
